{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>SitPose 是一款專為上班族設計的 calmly 姿勢教練，能透過手機前置鏡頭與端側姿勢偵測技術，即時監控您的坐姿。當系統偵測到您駝背或頸部前伸時，會以聲音、語音提示或觸覺回饋溫柔提醒您調整回正確姿勢，工作結束後更能提供靜態的坐姿摘要報告。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-242.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線隱私保護與個人化校準</h2>\n<p>該 App 完全於裝置本地運行，利用 Apple Vision 框架在記憶體中分析影像，絕不錄製、儲存或上傳任何視頻，無需註冊帳號亦無追蹤伺服器，嚴格保障用戶私隱。使用者可根據自身標準姿勢進行校準，設定專屬敏感度，並享有寬限期功能以避免短暫動作誤觸提醒，同時支援站立休息通知及自動暫停計時，確保數據真實且不干擾專注力。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-292-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-293-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-294-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-295-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SitPose – Posture Monitoring</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/sitpose-posture-monitoring/id6774993071?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:58:01.316404+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:48:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T22:56:02.389856+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:51:29.052093+00:00","content_hash":"35f6e5f6ae47e6c2ae2f0ab11a0f8daf449b37e7300adf9b5b1c67bf27c58184","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}